#   rows 0 to 12: what happens in the Marvel Cinematic Universe, at its in-universe date.
#   rows 14 to 23: films, series and studio milestones, at their release.
#   rows 25 to 31: comics, at their cover date.
# Relations labelled "adapted" lead from a comic to what adapted it, and "shows" from a film to an event it shows.
